# A group update (`group := groups.get(key) ?? fallback`, writes of `group`, then `groups[key] = group`) that a panic or a failure leaves half-way shows what the same update with the copy written out shows, whether the build grows the entry in place or copies the group because a scope guard's closure names the Map. `jet run` and the none, basic and release builds agree.
fixture: a_group_update_left_half_way_shows_the_same_map_on_every_tier.fixture
env: NO_COLOR=1
env: JET_STORE_DIR={work}/cache
env: JETPACK_ROOT={work}/jetpack
step: jet run main.jet
exit: 0
